# 💳 Fraud Detection System Using Machine Learning

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Fraud Detection System** is a machine learning project designed to identify potentially fraudulent financial transactions.

The project uses transaction data to train a classification model that distinguishes between legitimate and fraudulent transactions. The objective is to help identify suspicious activities and reduce financial fraud.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze financial transaction data.
- Perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA).
- Clean and preprocess the dataset.
- Identify patterns associated with fraudulent transactions.
- Train a machine learning classification model.
- Evaluate model performance.

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Category | Technologies |
|---|---|
| Programming | Python |
| Data Analysis | Pandas, NumPy |
| Visualization | Matplotlib, Seaborn |
| Machine Learning | Scikit-learn |
| Development | PyCharm |
| Version Control | Git & GitHub |

